    "notes": "The start island: the classic corner island: an L of grass on dirt, three deep, with an oak and a chest, drawn by the Skyblock flow from vanilla blocks named by id. The chest at 7, 3, 3 names its block entity id and the loot table msm_sample_game_modes:sky_survival/start_chest, so it fills the first time it is opened. Change it in the Structure Studio, or build your own in the game and bring it in."
